.TH std::locale::encoding 3 "2026.11.10" "http://cppreference.com" "C++ Standard Libary"
.SH NAME
std::locale::encoding \- std::locale::encoding

.SH Synopsis
std::text_encoding encoding() const;

Returns a std::text_encoding object that represents the implementation-defined encoding
scheme associated with the locale *this.

.SH Return value

A std::text_encoding object that represents the associated encoding scheme.

